# =============================================================================
# FORGE DROPSHIP — runtime config TEMPLATE (.env.example)
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. This is a template only. The REAL file next to it is  dropship.env
#   2. Copy this file:  cp dropship.env.example dropship.env  then edit values.
#   3. Redeploy (push.sh) so the box reloads. The real dropship.env is
#      git-ignored, lives OUTSIDE the web root, and must 404 over HTTP.
#
# FORGE DROPSHIP is the e-commerce / dropshipping workspace. Its agent crew
# (Midas the director + Hawk / Blaze / Otto) reads the store, proposes moves,
# and self-improves — but NEVER takes an outward action on its own. Launching an
# ad, placing/approving a supplier order, publishing a listing, or messaging a
# customer all stay your one-tap approval.
#
# SAFETY:
#   This folder is a SIBLING of the web app ("forge rei/"), so it lives OUTSIDE
#   the web-served dir. Nothing here is reachable over HTTP. Keys stay private.
# =============================================================================

# --- Shopify (store backbone) ------------------------------------------------
# Admin API access token from a custom app in your Shopify admin
# (Settings → Apps and sales channels → Develop apps). Scopes needed:
# read_orders, read_products, read_inventory (+ write_* later for gated actions).
SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
SHOPIFY_ADMIN_TOKEN=shpat_...
SHOPIFY_API_VERSION=2024-10

# --- WinningHunter (product + ad research → the decision packet) --------------
# Powers dropship_winninghunter.py: which ads are running, HOW LONG each creative
# has been live (the proof-of-profit proxy — nobody funds a losing ad for 90 days),
# which stores sell it, at what price.
#
# WHY PAID AT ALL: Meta's FREE Ad Library API returns non-EU ads only when they're
# about social issues, elections or politics. US commercial dropship ads are visible
# in the browser UI but are NOT returned by the free API. That gap is the whole
# justification for this line item.
#
# ⚠️  BEFORE PAYING: their docs never state which plan tier unlocks API access. A 403
# from this client means exactly that. Ask their sales point-blank whether Basic
# includes API + MCP, or whether it's a higher tier.
#
# ⚠️  SHAPE UNVERIFIED: paths/auth below are best-guess until an account exists —
# their docs sit behind a login. All of it is env-overridable ON PURPOSE so one edit
# here fixes the shape with no code change and no redeploy (the mistake already sitting
# in dropship_pipiads.py was hardcoding a guessed shape). Limits: 60 req/min, 20,000
# credits per calendar month. Accuracy: sales COUNTS 70-98%, revenue ±20-40%.
WINNINGHUNTER_API_KEY=
# WINNINGHUNTER_API_BASE=https://app.winninghunter.com
# WINNINGHUNTER_AUTH_HEADER=Authorization
# WINNINGHUNTER_AUTH_PREFIX=Bearer
# WINNINGHUNTER_ADS_PATH=/api/v1/ads
# WINNINGHUNTER_STORE_PATH=/api/v1/stores
# WINNINGHUNTER_PRODUCTS_PATH=/api/v1/products
# WINNINGHUNTER_HEALTH_PATH=/api/v1/me

# --- EverBee (Etsy keyword + listing research) -------------------------------
# Powers etsy_everbee.py. The ONLY Etsy research vendor with a real documented API
# (verified OpenAPI 3.0.3 spec) — eRank, Alura, Sale Samurai, Marmalead, Koalanda and
# Roketfy have no API of any kind, and none of them ship an MCP server.
# Credentials: dev.everbee.io → register an app. Limits: 10 req/sec, 50,000 per
# rolling 24h.
#
# ⚠️  BEFORE PAYING, two things no agent can see (both login-gated):
#   1. is the API a separate paid ADD-ON? their pricing is published nowhere.
#   2. does your tier actually return est_mo_sales / est_mo_revenue? their guide says
#      data is "filtered to match that user's subscription" — a lower tier may return
#      keywords while nulling the sales fields. A null lands as Unknown, correctly.
#
# ACCURACY: keyword volume is MODELLED, not measured (the schema carries `cpc` beside
# `vol` — the Google Keyword Planner field set). Etsy never exposes per-listing sales,
# so est_mo_sales is modelled too. Ground truth = Etsy Marketplace Insights (Etsy Plus,
# $10/mo, dashboard-only, no API) — use it to CALIBRATE this feed, not to replace it.
#
# We deliberately do NOT call Etsy's own API here: its Terms (2025-06-16) prohibit use
# "for purposes of analytics, machine learning, training artificial intelligence models".
# Routing through EverBee leaves that exposure with EverBee.
EVERBEE_CLIENT_ID=
EVERBEE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# EVERBEE_API_BASE=https://research-open-api.everbee.com

# --- AutoDS (sourcing + order automation) ------------------------------------
# API key from AutoDS (Settings → API). STORE_ID is the AutoDS store id.
#
# ⚠️  The AutoDS REST API is NOT recommended (2026-07-28 review): access requires
# approval PLUS a one-time activation fee whose amount is unpublished, there is no
# trial, and per their own help center "You must commit to the activation fee before
# receiving access to the API documentation." You cannot evaluate it before buying.
# (A "$5,000" figure circulating online is FABRICATED — the raw HTML of every page
# cited for it was grepped and contains no such number. Don't budget against it.)
# Their MCP server, by contrast, is real, first-party and FREE on every plan:
# https://mcp.autods.com/mcp — OAuth 2.1 + PKCE, ~1h token expiry, so AUTODS_MCP_TOKEN
# below needs a refresh companion or it silently 401s. Worth taking only if you
# subscribe to AutoDS for FULFILLMENT; skip the $14.97/mo Product Finding Hub (it's
# rebranded ad-library scraping, unreachable by agent, and has no CSV export).
AUTODS_API_KEY=
AUTODS_STORE_ID=

# --- Apify → Meta Ad Library (competitor-ad watcher, "Competitor Ads" panel) --
# Pulls the ads competitors are ACTUALLY running, with how long each has been
# running — longevity is the proxy for "it converts". Token: apify.com →
# Settings → Integrations → Personal API token. Blank = the panel reads
# "add key" and spends $0.
#
# COST: this actor bills PER AD SCRAPED (~$0.00075/ad) plus Apify compute, so a
# careless pull is real money. DROPSHIP_ADSPY_MAX_ADS is the HARD ceiling applied
# to every call (the UI/API limit is clamped down to it) — raise it deliberately.
# Pulls are manual-only; nothing polls on a timer.
APIFY_TOKEN=
DROPSHIP_ADSPY_ACTOR=curious_coder~facebook-ads-library-scraper
DROPSHIP_ADSPY_MAX_ADS=50
DROPSHIP_ADSPY_COUNTRY=US

# --- Meta Ads (Facebook / Instagram) -----------------------------------------
# Reuses the same Meta pattern the agency side uses. Long-lived access token +
# a JSON map of {label: act_XXXXXXposit} ad-account ids.
META_ACCESS_TOKEN=
META_AD_ACCOUNT_MAP={}

# --- Anthropic (the crew's OWN Claude key) -----------------------------------
# Optional. If unset the crew FALLS BACK to the shared agency/wholesale key, so
# they work before a dedicated key is set. Placeholder values are ignored.
# DROPSHIP_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Cadence + self-improvement (box loop knobs) -----------------------------
# Hours between Midas's autonomous operating-brief refreshes on the box. Set to 24
# so the crew doesn't burn Claude tokens on a timer when nothing changed; the manual
# "Learn from brain" / run-brief buttons still work on demand. Lower it if you want
# more frequent autonomous briefs (each brief is a paid Claude call).
FORGE_DROPSHIP_BRIEF_EVERY_H=24
# Briefs Midas must produce before an auto self-improve fires (so learn ≈ every
# LEARN_EVERY × BRIEF_EVERY_H hours). The manual learn button ignores this.
FORGE_DROPSHIP_LEARN_EVERY=8
# Minimum minutes between self-improvement writes (rate guard).
FORGE_DROPSHIP_LEARN_GAP_MIN=45

# --- Obsidian brain (vault) --------------------------------------------------
# Optional override for the Agentic-OS Obsidian vault path. The crew reads their
# learned playbooks from <vault>/Skills/<agent>-playbook.md in addition to the
# local skills/ seeds in this folder.
# FORGE_VAULT=/Users/yg4st/Desktop/Agentic-OS/vault

# =============================================================================
# NOT WIRED YET — add-key stubs. Drop a value here and the matching integration
# lights up on the next deploy; until then that channel reads mock / "add key".
# =============================================================================
# --- PiPiAds (trending-product / ad-spy signal — powers Product Watch) --------
# The "watch new trending things" source: real winning TikTok/FB products + TikTok
# Shop revenue trend, so Hawk scores products that are ACTUALLY moving instead of
# guesses. Get the API key + billing at https://www.pipispy.com/ . Routes are
# env-overridable (confirm against your plan's API docs before first pull):
# PIPIADS_API_KEY=
# PIPIADS_API_BASE=https://open.pipiads.com
# PIPIADS_TRENDING_PATH=/api/v1/products/trending
# PIPIADS_SEARCH_PATH=/api/v1/products/search
# PIPIADS_AUTH_HEADER=Authorization
# --- MCP servers (Connections & MCP tab) -------------------------------------
# The dashboard talks to MCP servers over Streamable HTTP. A server's URL is edited
# in the Connections & MCP tab; these env vars are the DEFAULTS it starts from, and
# any token stays HERE — the UI only ever references a variable NAME, never a value.
#
# Shopify Storefront MCP: your store's own endpoint (catalog, cart, policies). Left
# blank it is derived from SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN above as https://<domain>/api/mcp.
# SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_MCP_URL=
#
# AutoDS MCP: paste the URL when you have it, then hit Probe in the Connections tab —
# the real tool list loads from the server itself, no redeploy. Sourcing reads keep
# working over the REST bridge (AUTODS_API_KEY above) meanwhile.
# AUTODS_MCP_URL=
# AUTODS_MCP_TOKEN=
#
# (The Shopify Dev MCP — `npx -y @shopify/dev-mcp@latest` — is a stdio server. It runs
# in your Claude/operator session; the box cannot reach it, so it is listed in the tab
# for reference only and never shows as "connected".)

# --- AutoDS Marketplace (Product Finding Hub — winning products) --------------
# Uses your existing AUTODS_API_KEY above. The marketplace/finder is a PAID AutoDS
# add-on and may not be on every tier's API — confirm the path, then set it:
# AUTODS_MARKETPLACE_PATH=/marketplace/products/
# --- TikTok (Ads / TikTok Shop) ----------------------------------------------
# TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# TIKTOK_ADVERTISER_ID=
# TIKTOK_SHOP_ID=
# --- Klaviyo (email / SMS marketing) -----------------------------------------
# KLAVIYO_API_KEY=
# --- Google Analytics 4 ------------------------------------------------------
# GA4_PROPERTY_ID=
# GA4_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
# --- Shipment tracking -------------------------------------------------------
# AFTERSHIP_API_KEY=
# --- GoHighLevel (own sub-account — customer SMS, owner-initiated only) -------
# GHL_API_KEY=
# GHL_LOCATION_ID=
# --- Higgsfield (ad video / image creative) ----------------------------------
# HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=
# HIGGSFIELD_API_SECRET=
# --- Metricool (social scheduling) -------------------------------------------
# METRICOOL_USER_TOKEN=
